# Offline NuGet install (see dotnet/offline-packages/READ-ME-FIRST.txt).
#
# The 160 .nupkg files AND dotnet/nuget.config are COMMITTED, deliberately, so that a clone or
# a GitHub ZIP download builds on an air-gapped machine with no setup whatsoever. An earlier
# version of this file ignored both; that was correct only while the packages lived outside
# the repo.
#
# Only the extracted cache is ignored - NuGet regenerates it from the .nupkg on every restore.
dotnet/packages-cache/
